    "notes": "The user explicitly set the trash-bin nominal product dimensions to 40x40x60 cm. The previously measured raw GLB transform scale is not used as product dimensions; the existing model renderer normalizes model geometry to descriptor bounds. Exact product identity is DEPOT_PLASTIC_TRASH_BIN and modelFile is plastic_trash_bin.glb. The new item remains decision-required under F-014; no BOM classification is invented. Automatic depot packing is derived from the catalog dimensions and keeps the trash bin, mini fridge and coat rack footprints disjoint; kettle retains its existing supported fridge-top relationship. Existing generic catalog Add behavior is preserved rather than inventing a new default free-placement position in this feature. The full-system reverse-dependency, test, documentation and finding surfaces reported by the gate are explicitly reviewed here; declaration does not imply unrelated behavior changes in those files."
